<p id="loop-desc" class="loop-sr">The inner loop: Plan, Build, Review, Verify, Merged. A review can send work back to Build with changes requested, and so can the AI Leader at Verify, asking for more changes. A question about the plan sends work back to Plan, and the AI Leader can send a plan back. Your reserved decisions wait at Verify. After Merged, the next ready feature starts the loop again at Plan.</p><svg class="loopmap loopmap-wide" viewBox="0 0 1200 460" role="img" aria-labelledby="loop-desc"><defs><marker id="dl-fwd" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8.5" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#101A26"/></marker><marker id="dl-back" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8.5" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#E4572E"/></marker><marker id="dl-next" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8.5" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0 0 L10 5 L0 10 z" fill="#3D5A80"/></marker></defs><polyline points="250,220 294,220" fill="none" stroke="#101A26" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linejoin="miter" marker-end="url(#dl-fwd)"/><polyline points="486,220 530,220" fill="none" stroke="#101A26" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linejoin="miter" marker-end="url(#dl-fwd)"/><polyline points="722,220 766,220" fill="none" stroke="#101A26" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linejoin="miter" marker-end="url(#dl-fwd)"/><polyline points="958,220 1002,220" fill="none" stroke="#101A26" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linejoin="miter" marker-end="url(#dl-fwd)"/><polyline points="627.0,280 627.0,342 391.0,342 391.0,284" fill="none" stroke="#E4572E" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linejoin="miter" marker-end="url(#dl-back)"/><text x="509.0" y="364" text-anchor="middle" class="w-label w-back">Changes requested</text><polyline points="391.0,160 391.0,104 185.0,104 185.0,156" fill="none" stroke="#E4572E" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linejoin="miter" marker-end="url(#dl-back)"/><text 